---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Home
description: A registry built for the molosser breeds. DNA-verified pedigrees, health-tested breeding stock and a public registry.
---
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <h1>A registry built for the molosser breeds</h1>
    <p class="lead">DNA-verified pedigrees, health-tested breeding stock and a public registry for the Boerboel, Cane Corso and Presa Canario.</p>
    <p><a class="button" href="/registration/">Start a registration</a></p>
    <p class="eyebrow">Est. {{ site.established }}</p>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="container page-body">
  <h2>Breeds we register</h2>
  <div class="card-grid">
    {%- for b in breeds %}
    <a class="breed-card" href="/breeds/{{ b.slug }}/">
      <img src="{{ b.image }}" alt="{{ b.imageAlt }}" style="object-position: {{ b.imagePosition }}" loading="lazy">
      <h3>{{ b.name }}</h3>
      <p>{{ b.blurb }}</p>
      <span>Breed standard &rarr;</span>
    </a>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
  <p><strong>More molosser breeds coming.</strong> MIA plans to open registration to more mastiff-type breeds.</p>

  <p class="standard-note">Scaffold only: the rest of the home page is ported from the prototype in step 3.</p>
</div>
